The space bar fires keypress in Ladybird, with the key " " and a
charCode of 32, between keydown and beforeinput. From their sources,
the other engines do the same: Blink dispatches keypress for the char
event that the platform makes for any key that types text, in its
KeyboardEventManager::KeyEvent(), and WebKit does it for the char event
that its EventHandler::keyEvent() disambiguates. Gecko dispatches it for
every key but modifier and dead keys, as WidgetKeyboardEvent::
ShouldCauseKeypressEvents() decides.
